# Only the Dockerfiles and agent-side package are needed in the build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.bun-sourcemap-agent
!trace_lab/
!trace_lab/**

# Do not re-include local credentials or runtime outputs inside the package.
**/.env*
**/runs/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/.cache/
**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
